FILE: spec.rs
MOD: commands/spec
OWNS: spec-version-display; llmcode-spec-command; arch-spec-command
PROFILE: [pure-core]
CHANGE-FREQUENCY: stable

run: bool * bool → Result<(), String> [pure]
  note: --llmcode prints LLMCODE_SPEC constant; --arch prints ARCH_SPEC constant; no flags prints usage listing both; both flags prints both specs

DEPENDS-ON: schema

KEY-INVARIANTS:
- LLMCODE_SPEC and ARCH_SPEC constants in schema.rs are the source of truth for grammar documentation — spec::run() is the user-visible contract for those specs
- Both specs are bundled as compile-time constants (DR-01) — no file I/O required; spec works offline
